    {
      "id": 62,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Where the time goes",
      "description": "Seconds per minute spent waiting on Hyperliquid, per request type: the biggest bar is what makes a round slow -- a slow call made often outweighs a slower one made rarely.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 58,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
